Z||000011||theogre||05-04-2001||08:26 PM||||The pistons you have now and think are cyramic... those are phenolic.<P>phenolic is a VHT plastic. The advantages are that it is smoother than steel and doesn't conduct heat.<P>For what the pistons and seals cost you may as well just order the rebuilts.||||reg||1
